---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import SiteCTA from '../components/SiteCTA.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Solar EPC & System Care | Incetekh Energy"
  description="Solar EPC, free site visits, system performance checks, annual yield audits and a five-year warranty subject to written proposal terms."
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Services & capabilities"
    title="From a rooftop idea to a working system."
    description="Solar engineering, procurement and construction, with services for the system after installation."
  />
  <nav class="container service-navigation" aria-label="On this page">
    <a class="text-link" href="#epc">
      Solar EPC
    </a>
    <a class="text-link" href="#site-visit">
      Free site visits
    </a>
    <a class="text-link" href="#system-care">
      System care
    </a>
    <a class="text-link" href="#warranty">
      Warranty
    </a>
  </nav>
  <div class="container services">
    <section
      id="epc"
      class="section-grid service-detail"
      aria-labelledby="epc-heading"
    >
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / Solar EPC</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="epc-heading" class="section-title">
          Engineering.
          <br />
          Procurement.
          <br />
          Construction.
        </h2>
        <p class="lead">
          The three parts of taking a solar installation from a plan to a
          physical system.
        </p>
        <dl class="epc-list">
          <div>
            <dt>Engineering</dt>
            <dd>
              Planning the solar installation around the site and its
              requirements.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Procurement</dt>
            <dd>
              Sourcing the equipment and materials specified for the
              installation.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Construction</dt>
            <dd>Bringing the proposed installation together on site.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p>
          Tell us whether you are enquiring about a home, business, industrial
          building or institution. The site and proposed scope need to be
          assessed before suitability, system size or cost can be confirmed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section
      class="section-grid service-detail"
      id="site-visit"
      aria-labelledby="visit-heading"
    >
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / Site visits</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="visit-heading" class="section-title">
          A free site visit.
        </h2>
        <p>
          Call to discuss your location and arrange a site visit. Have a recent
          electricity bill and an idea of your available roof space ready for
          the conversation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Site access, visit arrangements and any project-specific requirements
          can be discussed directly with the team.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section
      class="section-grid service-detail"
      id="system-care"
      aria-labelledby="checks-heading"
    >
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / System care</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="checks-heading" class="section-title">
          Keep performance
          <br />
          in view.
        </h2>
        <h3>System performance checks</h3>
        <p>
          A check on how your solar system is performing. When you call, explain
          what you have noticed and share any generation records you already
          have.
        </p>
        <h3>Annual yield audits</h3>
        <p>
          An annual review of energy generation. Ask about the information
          needed and the scope of the audit for your system.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section
      class="section-grid service-detail"
      id="warranty"
      aria-labelledby="warranty-heading"
    >
      <p class="eyebrow">04 / Warranty</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="warranty-heading" class="section-title">
          5-year warranty.
          <br />
          Clear written terms.
        </h2>
        <p class="lead">
          The five-year warranty is subject to your written proposal and the
          applicable warranty terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before proceeding, confirm what is covered, any exclusions, when the
          warranty begins and how to request support.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <SiteCTA />
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .service-navigation {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    column-gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .service-detail {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .epc-list {
    margin-block: var(--space-8);
  }
  .epc-list > div {
    padding-block: var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  dt,
  h3 {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
  dd {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
